    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/b37916f16b7a34902180cb223bc2f997.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Don\u2019t Tell Mom: I Fed My Stepsister</strong> \ud83d\udca6\ud83d\ude33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spicy adult visual novel with motel drama, mini-games, and choices that get... complicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After inheriting a rundown family motel, Leo is forced to grow up fast \u2014 especially when he discovers his stepsister Billie already living there, taking a break before college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/1c396f843381fade612cbd4c3e319ad9.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=178 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The business is falling apart, debts are piling up, and Billie\u2019s not exactly making it easier\u2026 or maybe she is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your days. Get to know Billie. Share breakfasts, secrets, and maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got four weeks to turn the place around \u2014 or let it all go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/e0b3dc2b57efd216f3e7be5427349345.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=191 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Visual Novel</strong> \u2014 Make choices that shape relationships, events, and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Daily Tasks</strong> \u2014 Clean rooms, help out at reception, or just enjoy the &quot;view.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2014 Will you build a life together\u2026 or let her chase her dreams alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy Adult Content</strong> \u2014 Packed with 18+ scenes, flirty tension, and unexpected moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable with One Hand</strong> \u2014 ( \u0361~ \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0) Priorities. We get it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/b37916f16b7a34902180cb223bc2f997.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Don\u2019t Tell Mom: I Fed My Stepsister</strong> \ud83d\udca6\ud83d\ude33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spicy adult visual novel with motel drama, mini-games, and choices that get... complicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/70cef0ee2a2b9430a7830608cc5f7bad.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After inheriting a rundown family motel, Leo is forced to grow up fast \u2014 especially when he discovers his stepsister Billie already living there, taking a break before college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/1c396f843381fade612cbd4c3e319ad9.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=178 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The business is falling apart, debts are piling up, and Billie\u2019s not exactly making it easier\u2026 or maybe she is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/971c2b3f31c5adb72eecf8d32588c54f.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your days. Get to know Billie. Share breakfasts, secrets, and maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got four weeks to turn the place around \u2014 or let it all go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.poster.avif?t=1755535668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.webm?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/f5e52a02da608937b6454325b66e012d.mp4?t=1755535668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718550/extras/e0b3dc2b57efd216f3e7be5427349345.avif?t=1755535668\" width=598 height=191 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Visual Novel</strong> \u2014 Make choices that shape relationships, events, and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Daily Tasks</strong> \u2014 Clean rooms, help out at reception, or just enjoy the &quot;view.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2014 Will you build a life together\u2026 or let her chase her dreams alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy Adult Content</strong> \